      "repair_reason": "- [P1] The remaining blocker is contributor or Mantis positive bridge proof plus maintainer acceptance of fail-closed behavior, not a narrow automated code repair.; Cleared: The diff only changes RPC parameter plumbing and tests; it does not modify dependencies, CI, secrets, permissions, package resolution, or downloaded code. (sha=adb2ac1434f70719082c847dd32e0f72d3231e78)",
      "review_summary": "The PR parses plain JSON-RPC `send` reply-target aliases, forwards them as `selectedMessageGuid` to bridge sends, blocks AppleScript fallback for reply-target sends, and adds focused RPC bridge tests.\n\nReproducibility: yes. from source inspection: current main's plain RPC send path never reads reply aliases and its bridge helper does not include `selectedMessageGuid`, while `send.rich` already maps those aliases. I did not run a live Messages bridge send in this read-only review.",
